# Security owns this repository.
#
# pipeline-security holds the scanners that run in other repos' workflow stages,
# so a change here lands in every consuming pipeline. Security reviews all of it.
#
# NOTE: this file is only advisory unless branch protection on `main` has
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled with at least one required approval.

# Default owner for everything.
*                     @affinidi/affinidi-security

# The scanners themselves.
/.github/workflows/   @affinidi/affinidi-security

# Global Snyk policy: ignores and expiries change what every scan reports.
/.snyk-global         @affinidi/affinidi-security

# Ownership itself: changing this file needs security sign-off.
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @affinidi/affinidi-security
